              "type": "text-content",
              "content": {
                "de": {
                  "content": "<p># Our Process We start with a question: *what if?* What if we could make something that lasts a lifetime? What if every material was chosen with intention? What if less really could be more? These questions guide us through months of prototyping, testing, and refinement. We work with artisans who share our values—people who've spent decades mastering their craft. The result is something we're proud to put our name on. Something we hope you'll treasure for years to come.</p>"
                }
              },
